    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "The main convoy. This is the landship we were protecting. Now it's hauling our wounded."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Looks like it's still under construction. I can't tell how it all fits together. Weird."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "(But the shadow I saw... It was... Some questions are better left unanswered.)"
