            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So what's the deal with 'the boss of this place?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You look nervous. And I don't need to blind myself with Originium Arts to figure that out."
