        "value": "Closure",
        "text": "Okay! Your Majesty!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Closure",
        "text": "Give me three days! If I can't fix it in three days, I'll take the whole security control system apart and reinstall it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056",
            "name2": "avg_npc_050",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Re-reinstall? You can do that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056",
            "name2": "avg_npc_050",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Closure",
        "text": "I dunno who built these mysterious systems and then buried them out in Rim Billiton somewhere, then if we can't figure it out..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Closure",
        "text": "We'll just have to replace it with something we can! Easy peasy!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056",
            "name2": "avg_npc_050",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Well... I'll leave you to it then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056",
            "name2": "avg_npc_050",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Closure",
        "text": "Roger that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "...*Sigh*."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Rhodes Island... how long will it be until you're up and running...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You're... I remember, you were with Hoederer..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You've regained consciousness? Your wounds were quite serious."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(Did I scare her...?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'm W, the mercenary. I'm looking for Captain Hoederer and I kinda got lost..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Be careful where you wander. This place is still being built. There are a lot of exposed wires. You could get shocked."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "But I have a feeling such caution is second nature to you, no?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "W, was it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You may call me Theresa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Hoederer had words with the Doctor after our meeting. I believe he should be back in his room in Medical by now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Don't make them worry. You ought to head back too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Theresa... Your Majesty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Oh? Well, we're not in Kazdel anymore. No need for titles."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Okay, Theresa... Majesty, why were you wrestling with a door just now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "And that short girl there is an engineer, right? I mean, it's just a door..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "It's not just a door."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "O... kay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "How many things are there totally unworthy of my attention?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So what's Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Oh, you heard that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "That is the name of this vessel. Although it has not yet been officially christened... that is the name I wish for it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Maybe it's just my whimsy. The Doctor and Kal'tsit may reject its 'true name.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "...Heh. True name? For this landship?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "You saw. This vessel wasn't built in Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Searching deep in the oldest records we have, I came across that name..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "'Rhodes Island.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "I'm not actually sure what it means. Hm... Kal'tsit should know more."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "But that is what I want to name it. It already had a name, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(Her Majesty Theresa fought against the Regent who usurped Kazdel... She personally brought together more than half the Sarkaz clans...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(...and she's fixing a door herself?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "What's wrong? You have an odd expression on your face."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Would it be considered improper to laugh in front of Your Majesty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "N-no... But neither Kal'tsit nor the Doctor are the laughing type... and the warriors have too much on their plates for such frivolity."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "I would quite like it if you all would smile."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "But that is perhaps an extravagant hope. I understand the pressure I've placed on everyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So I'm cool to laugh then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Um, yes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Nah, the magic's gone. Can't do it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Why do I feel like that's my fault?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Hehe... well, I wouldn't dare."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "What about me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "I am Theresa, this is Rhodes Island, and you are?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "'W'......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "That's not what I mean. 'W' is a mercenary codename. I want to know your true name. The one that represents you.."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "You need not cloak yourself in a disguise tainted by war. This goes beyond names. Let's just say I'm nosy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Oh... forgive me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "You don't have a name?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "It's pretty common for Sarkaz born in Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "We don't really care much for... names. People forget them all the time. What's the point in making an effort to remember a name?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "I don't want to forget them. I can't forget them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "If you wait for the dust to settle in Kazdel... until you're no longer 'W,' we could speak like this once again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Maybe then you could have a more fitting name. A proper name for a Sarkaz woman like yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Like Rhodes Island. A name makes things feel so much warmer, doesn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I never really thought about it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_049",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Theresa, message."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Kazdel is on the move. The Doctor is getting ready."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_056"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "Right, I'm on my way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "W?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Oh, yeah, I'm here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_056",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Theresa",
        "text": "If you are willing to fight for us still, you will always be welcome here. No matter what."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.7,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.7,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_049"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...*Sigh*."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I'm not going to criticize Theresa's decision, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Don't expect too warm a welcome. I've seen your record. You're dangerous."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_049",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Oh. Same?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046",
            "name2": "avg_npc_049",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You're recovering fast, but not enough to have you wandering around as you please."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Go back to bed before we have to have someone carry you there."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
            "key": "$loneliness_loop",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "I realized later."
    },
    {
        "text": "I never dared to look Theresa in the eye."
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked so naive."
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't the look of a leader at the head of one of the armies in our cruel war..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is naive the word...?"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have eyes like that when you're naive... Such... sad eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "And those two were always at her side, it seemed."
    },
    {
        "text": "If... if I could stand with them..."
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of sights would I see?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_048"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(That hood... is that the 'Doctor' they were talking about?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(Is that person... looking my way...?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "\uff08......\uff09"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(What the... Why...?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(Am I scared? Scared of what? That person gives off pretty normal vibes, but...? No, it's too vague. I've never seen anyone that weird before...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "(Oh... that's Babel's battlefield commander. I remember now...)"
    },
